    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89dcbe959b556df83697c1f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我慌忙起身。看来我做了一场梦。\n一旦认识到是梦，\n梦中记忆就开始如同流水般洒落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "749aa7786f14b61d27054fa56f7fb911e3207eaa3f3b822650daadd415c918db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45987d031f72f8afa90f6b5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "依稀记得\n自己似乎正想阻止某人离去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76ddadf20cb902163b96e4a6215cc46d4c7cc7e78346e10e0367ac1df7e54f51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3cc69053e33fac9f96ac0a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……转换一下心情吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a91a5b2bc6f992a454e00e1c157d8b12990ae6340331ac3c673300bf6ffae3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3690983224baa3aad376304",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但对方究竟是谁呢……\n越是努力回想记忆就越模糊，\n怎么样都想不起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cedd0577b2e861fe145eebd84f4be0d47c3e22bd6fb120927c3e0533bfd2be99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2fe569298953e672d950eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……博客打不开……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73549f495017b508a0ac3b09fb3ed9db23ca57869501d6c8492b8cc513552796",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317836b4bc85e920f137a2d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了梦境钻牛角尖也不是办法，\n我打开电脑点进博客，\n这是我的每日例行公事，然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd18bb32b7973850890c36cf7f896622c825187b3fcf785f4e70587fed42e3cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a37de87088cb7bec78e4873",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说起来我为什么要打开博客……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51b5f9d706152b415d05fcdb3f653911dbecf1d2b78aa8a70ba1dea5915e5b50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc38a10e4d6cc1e096b758f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我试着点进其他网站确认，都进得去。\n我满头问号，接着突然想到──",
      "source_fingerprint": "708f2556141178fa9c36a16e14573520a7c338d3d3f7e85b8b2bf2f0f17b4a4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf9f17857fd96f55af2a56d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "刚刚什么都没想就自然地点进博客……\n但说起来我这么做的\n目的是为了什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73971e8b43a923b98a1f522e96f0afc95394ade25cf2246f996b32676b4af67c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bdfee1182d23b1a4993da86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我可能是太累了）",
      "source_fingerprint": "279b43b20169b2a628608f67bb8127e633d15f112c228982cfba85277388dd77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:409644e73ac69323c1f4a5ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总觉得自己似乎忘记了某种事物，\n但我甚至不知道自己忘记了什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "280174cf139ebef6182e8b479058bc7f908f328f2ce72362fab6736b99b6247a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5a5a493ff33dc68eeff9cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "望向窗外一看，天气晴朗。\n我打开窗户试图缓和心情。\n──此时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "309b6fef374686c765e0cf99b144cb354b8f5ab731d04bdfe38ae3576947bdb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c1c354202b34b33e6e2a726",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fa91dd7af96b2b0550866e59d8cc9e203ae26c64b4cada1a9b2e1b8269397d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3cf4d07ffecf5a9b52c3da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（风吹……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d930b0bd0d8b9f3afd313cefb02ef1cdb7e1f1781a0d95976a57be64d617c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb7138333f51f3bfe01f71a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然吹来一阵强风。\n桌上的书本、纸张与布偶\n一一被吹落在地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24071675319b13c6d7e6a551b39a823eb63b3974d43b9778063d449046d5a48f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea16bf2ce510dc29da0951eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是一片湛蓝的海洋。\n脚底触感柔软，四周飘着潮水的味道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95df0aa5003cf0ec396a4a51b283f9b4e926900c912fcd3197e730c6b90fcb7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac2b1530d60a7ebcf979de3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我急忙关上窗户捡拾地上的物品。\n最后捡起来的布偶比我意料中还沉重──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e59a7cd84cba7fb38c1bd5b595cb7a19c2e0a2ddf89fc2da137a4b43b3c8a661",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
