    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8d4268088df1f9ffa62905",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "脑海中逐渐浮现出某个场景。\n接着响起声音。\n我拼命侧耳倾听，深怕失去这条线索。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9e76981b74f4a5f388167d42c6a0038d26eeb71f2f2b6545aec7004da32d070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
