    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acc13370cc7ab2542b8af7c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某人正一脸惋惜地对我挥手。我茫然地\n望着对方，此时她却转向另一方──\n她转身面向了大海。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3a9817f2823eb89f51d79743e89a172d618d66c41298325458df4f30896529",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
