      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb64ed02148dcb0b8ae719f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我怎么会忘记呢？出现在我梦中的人\n就是真弓快车。写博客也是\n为了真弓快车而做的例行公事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98dfef2cf7388d64d4a7ca8748a3b85c8951ae3223f7222de224883d858605ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce43e45fc48aa70ccc4298f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "内心升起一阵难以压抑的不祥预感。\n我试着联络她，但电话没人接──",
      "source_fingerprint": "364fb4770eed91e45f73a70e5ed04dfffd755023183eae3aef81a849aec0ea65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087116.json",
      "json_path": [
