    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a559d1dae25a13e24513586",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我拼命地搜寻着脑海中的记忆，\n回想她喜欢的地方、她偏好的景色。\n除此之外她还可能去了哪里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "26f153afc5de4bb7fe408503105715ed793f702b12e671e685cd908203472e36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
